    "blocks": [
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Projection lets a collection drive the evaluation of a sub-expression, and the result is a new collection. The syntax for projection is "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ".![projectionExpression]"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ". For example, suppose we have a list of inventors but want the list of cities where they were born. Effectively, we want to evaluate "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "placeOfBirth.city"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " for every entry in the inventor list. The following example uses projection to do so:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "dlist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "// evaluates to [\"Smiljan\", \"Idvor\"]\nList placesOfBirth = parser.parseExpression(\"members.![placeOfBirth.city]\")\n\t\t.getValue(societyContext, List.class);"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "java",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Java"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "// evaluates to [\"Smiljan\", \"Idvor\"]\nval placesOfBirth = parser.parseExpression(\"members.![placeOfBirth.city]\")\n \t\t.getValue(societyContext) as List<*>"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "kotlin",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Kotlin"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "example",
        "id": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Projection is supported for arrays and anything that implements "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "java.lang.Iterable"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " or "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "java.util.Map"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ". When using a map to drive projection, the projection expression is evaluated against each entry in the map (represented as a Java "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Map.Entry"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "). The result of a projection across a map is a list that consists of the evaluation of the projection expression against each map entry."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The Spring Expression Language also supports safe navigation for collection projection."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "See "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Safe Collection Selection and Projection"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "core/expressions/language-ref/operator-safe-navigation.html#expressions-operator-safe-navigation-selection-and-projection"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " for details."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
